    "order-followers": "従者に命じる",
    "strengthen-your-bond": "絆を深める"
  },
  "body_html": "<p>統率者よ、あなたの部隊は基本で半ダースの手勢だ。タグ <em>集団</em> を持つ1体の従者として扱うこと。ここに記す初期値はすべて、プレイの中で変わりうる。</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">部隊</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"最大HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">最大HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"鎧\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">鎧</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"ダメージ\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"ダメージをロール\">ダメージ</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">HPは各6から、鎧は0から、ダメージはd6から始まる。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">タグ</h3>\n<p>あなたの部隊は、生い立ちで与えられるタグ <em>集団</em> に加え、あなたの選ぶ2つのタグを持って始まる。</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>弓兵</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>壮健</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>勇敢</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>抜け目ない</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>献身的</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"最初から選択済み\"> <span><em>集団</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>丈夫</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>威圧的</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>目端が利く</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>辛抱強い</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>人望がある</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>隠密</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>戦士</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自由記入\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自由記入\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自由記入\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>傑出</em> （「最後まで英雄」が必要）</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">本能</h3>\n<p>1つ選ぶ。</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>いがみ合い、仲間割れし、根に持つ</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>慣習と迷信に固執する</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>低俗な欲に溺れる</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>他人に威張り散らす</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>無用な危険を冒す</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>何事もやりすぎる</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自由記入\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">代価</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>1つ選ぶ。</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">忠誠</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"忠誠1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"忠誠1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"忠誠2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"忠誠2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"忠誠3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"忠誠3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>皆でどんちゃん騒ぎ</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>公の評価と敬意、名誉</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>彼らを助けるためにあなたが冒す危険</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>手強い敵に勝ち取った勝利</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>自分たちやストーントップのために得た富</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自由記入\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">所持品</h3>\n<p>3 ◇以下は軽い荷、4〜6 ◇は普通の荷、7〜9 ◇は重い荷。</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>手斧</strong>、鉄製（<em>至近</em>, <em>投擲</em>、x 貫通）</li><li>◇ <strong>槍</strong>、鉄製（<em>近接</em>, <em>投擲</em>、x 貫通）</li><li>◇ <strong>弓と鉄の矢</strong> (<em>近距離</em>、x 貫通、○ 矢残り僅か、○ 矢切れ）</li><li>◇◇ <strong>盾</strong> （+1鎧、守り抜くで7+なら構え+1）</li><li>◇◇ <strong>厚手の毛皮</strong> （鎧1、 <em>暖かい</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>外套</strong> (<em>暖かい</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>物資</strong> （隊員1人につき4+繁栄の使用）</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">物資</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"使用1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"使用1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"使用2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"使用2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"使用3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"使用3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"使用4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"使用4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"使用5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"使用5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"使用6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"使用6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"使用7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"使用7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"使用8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"使用8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"使用1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"使用1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"使用2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"使用2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"使用3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"使用3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"使用4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"使用4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"使用5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"使用5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"使用6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"使用6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"使用7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"使用7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"使用8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"使用8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"使用1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"使用1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"使用2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"使用2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"使用3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"使用3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"使用4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"使用4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"使用5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"使用5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"使用6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"使用6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"使用7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"使用7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"使用8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"使用8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">その他の装備</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">面々</h3>\n<p>誰かが頭角を現したら、名前とタグ、1つ以上の特徴を与えること。</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">名前</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"名前\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">タグ</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"タグ\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特徴</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特徴\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">名前</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"名前\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">タグ</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"タグ\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特徴</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特徴\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">名前</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"名前\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">タグ</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"タグ\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特徴</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特徴\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">名前</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"名前\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">タグ</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"タグ\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特徴</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特徴\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">名前</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"名前\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">タグ</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"タグ\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特徴</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特徴\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">名前</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"名前\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">タグ</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"タグ\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">特徴</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"特徴\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>名前の例：</strong> アレド、クルフウィッチ、エイラ、ゲラト、グラウ、ハリ、ロウリ、マーヴィン、ネスタ</p>\n<p><strong>タグの例：</strong> <em>動物好き、大柄、いじめっ子、皮肉屋、飲んだくれ、張り切り、博打打ち、欲張り、気難しい、騙されやすい、色男、正直、親切、下品、小柄、初心、年寄り、人気者、誇り高い、新入り、向こう見ず、恥知らず、鋭眼、短気</em></p>\n<p><strong>特徴の例：</strong> ___の子／きょうだい／親／従兄弟／___、禿頭、___に片想い、___への遺恨、___が大嫌い、___に心酔、冗談好き、だらしない、目／指／手／___の欠損、子供が恋しい、悪夢持ち、新婚、信心深い、傷跡、痩せぎす、毒舌、歌好き、いびき、ほら吹き、生真面目すぎ、家庭の悩み、口笛、木彫り好き</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">メモ</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"メモ\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">従者に命じる</h3>\n<p>あなたが <strong><em>従者にムーブを指図し、従者がそれを行う</em></strong>とき、相手のタグのいずれかが当てはまるなら+能力値の代わりに+1でロールする（さらに <em>傑出</em>なら+2）。当てはまるタグがなければ+0でロールする。タグのいずれかが邪魔になるなら、不利でロールする。</p>\n<p>従者が <strong><em>指図を受けていない</em></strong> とき、あるいは <strong><em>自分の考えで動く</em></strong>ときは、何をしてどうなるかをGMが告げる。</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">絆を深める</h3>\n<p>あなたが <strong><em>従者の代価を払い</em></strong> 、それが久しぶりのことなら、従者は忠誠+1をホールドする（最大3）。</p>\n<p>忠誠を1対1で費やして、次をさせられる：</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>恐れを抑えて、あなたの言うとおりにさせる</li><li>本能・タグ・気質のままに動くのを思いとどまらせる</li><li>気の進まないことをさせる（おぞましいことや自殺行為でない限り）</li></ul>"
}
